"children\\\":[null,[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L3\\\",null,{\\\"parallelRouterKey\\\":\\\"children\\\",\\\"error\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"errorStyles\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"errorScripts\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"template\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L4\\\",null,{}],\\\"templateStyles\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"templateScripts\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"notFound\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"forbidden\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"unauthorized\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}]]}],{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"slug\\\",\\\"complete-ai-security-audit-guide-2026\\\",\\\"d\\\"],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[null,[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L3\\\",null,{\\\"parallelRouterKey\\\":\\\"children\\\",\\\"error\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"errorStyles\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"errorScripts\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"template\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L4\\\",null,{}],\\\"templateStyles\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"templateScripts\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"notFound\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"forbidden\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"unauthorized\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}]]}],{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"__PAGE__\\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$L6\\\",null,[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L7\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$L8\\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L9\\\",null,{\\\"promise\\\":\\\"$@a\\\"}]]}]]}],{},null,false]},null,false]},null,false]},null,false],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"h\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[null,[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$Lb\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"$Lc\\\"}],null],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$Ld\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"hidden\\\":true,\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$e\\\",null,{\\\"fallback\\\":null,\\\"children\\\":\\\"$Lf\\\"}]}]}]]}],false]],\\\"m\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"G\\\":[\\\"$10\\\",[]],\\\"s\\\":false,\\\"S\\\":true}\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"11:I[2619,[\\\"619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/619-ba102abea3e3d0e4.js\\\",\\\"953\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/blog/%5Bslug%5D/page-ed7100482b98e3a0.js\\\"],\\\"\\\"]\\n12:T2b42,\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"\\u003cp class=\\\"font-body text-mid-gray text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\\\"\\u003e\\u003ch2 class=\\\"font-display text-navy text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4\\\"\\u003eWhat Is an AI Security Audit?\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"font-body text-mid-gray text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\\\"\\u003eAn AI security audit is a structured assessment of an organization's AI tool usage, data handling practices, governance posture, and compliance alignment. Unlike a traditional penetration test (which looks for technical exploits), an AI security audit examines the human and process layer — the decisions, policies, and practices that create AI-specific risk.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"font-body text-mid-gray text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\\\"\\u003eThe goal isn't to break into systems. The goal is to answer: \\u003cstrong class=\\\"text-navy font-semibold\\\"\\u003eDoes this organization know what AI they're using, what data it's touching, and whether their current controls are anywhere near adequate?\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"font-body text-mid-gray text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\\\"\\u003eFor most SMBs in 2026, the honest answer is no.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"font-body text-mid-gray text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\\\"\\u003e\\u003ch2 class=\\\"font-display text-navy text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4\\\"\\u003eWhy Traditional Security Audits Miss AI Risk\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"font-body text-mid-gray text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\\\"\\u003eYour existing security frameworks weren't built for AI. Here's the concrete problem:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"font-body text-mid-gray text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\\\"\\u003e\\u003cstrong class=\\\"text-navy font-semibold\\\"\\u003eNIST CSF 2.0\\u003c/strong\\u003e covers identify, protect, detect, respond, and recover. It says nothing about AI training data risks, model poisoning, prompt injection, or the governance gap created when employees use AI tools your CISO has never heard of.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"font-body text-mid-gray text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\\\"\\u003e\\u003cstrong class=\\\"text-navy font-semibold\\\"\\u003eISO 27001\\u003c/strong\\u003e is an excellent information security framework. It predates the LLM explosion. Its asset management controls assume you know what assets you have. Shadow AI is, by definition, invisible to your inventory.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"font-body text-mid-gray text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\\\"\\u003e\\u003cstrong class=\\\"text-navy font-semibold\\\"\\u003eSOC 2\\u003c/strong\\u003e Type II auditors are starting to ask about AI. But most organizations don't have AI-specific controls to show them.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"font-body text-mid-gray text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\\\"\\u003eThis is why a dedicated AI security audit exists. The frameworks above are necessary but not sufficient.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"font-body text-mid-gray text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\\\"\\u003e\\u003ch2 class=\\\"font-display text-navy text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4\\\"\\u003eThe 6-Domain AI Audit Methodology\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"font-body text-mid-gray text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\\\"\\u003eEvery AI security audit I conduct covers six domains. Together, they give you a complete picture of an organization's AI risk posture.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"font-body text-mid-gray text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\\\"\\u003e\\u003ch3 class=\\\"font-display text-navy text-lg font-bold mt-8 mb-3\\\"\\u003eDomain 1: AI Tool Inventory\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"font-body text-mid-gray text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\\\"\\u003eYou cannot secure what you don't know exists. The first domain is discovery — finding every AI tool in use across the organization, whether approved or not.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"font-body text-mid-gray text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\\\"\\u003eDiscovery techniques include:\\n\\u003cul class=\\\"list-disc space-y-1 my-3 pl-2\\\"\\u003e\\u003cli class=\\\"ml-4 text-mid-gray\\\"\\u003eDNS/proxy log analysis for known AI service domains\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli class=\\\"ml-4 text-mid-gray\\\"\\u003eBrowser extension inventory\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli class=\\\"ml-4 text-mid-gray\\\"\\u003eEmployee intake questionnaires\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli class=\\\"ml-4 text-mid-gray\\\"\\u003eApp store and SaaS spend reviews\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli class=\\\"ml-4 text-mid-gray\\\"\\u003eDirect manager interviews\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\nShadow AI will almost always surface here. Expect to find 2–3x more AI tools than the client thought they were using.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"font-body text-mid-gray text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\\\"\\u003e\\u003ch3 class=\\\"font-display text-navy text-lg font-bold mt-8 mb-3\\\"\\u003eDomain 2: Data Classification \\u0026 Handling\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"font-body text-mid-gray text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\\\"\\u003eOnce you have the inventory, you need to understand what data is flowing into each tool. The questions:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"font-body text-mid-gray text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\\\"\\u003e\\u003cul class=\\\"list-disc space-y-1 my-3 pl-2\\\"\\u003e\\u003cli class=\\\"ml-4 text-mid-gray\\\"\\u003eIs any PHI, PII, or confidential client data being entered into AI tools?\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli class=\\\"ml-4 text-mid-gray\\\"\\u003eIs data retention turned off for AI tools that offer it?\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli class=\\\"ml-4 text-mid-gray\\\"\\u003eAre employees uploading documents, spreadsheets, or email content to AI systems?\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli class=\\\"ml-4 text-mid-gray\\\"\\u003eWhat are the data processing terms for each AI vendor?\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\nThis domain frequently surfaces the highest-severity findings. A single employee pasting client contracts into ChatGPT can constitute a reportable data incident under GDPR or HIPAA.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"font-body text-mid-gray text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\\\"\\u003e\\u003ch3 class=\\\"font-display text-navy text-lg font-bold mt-8 mb-3\\\"\\u003eDomain 3: Access Controls \\u0026 Identity\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"font-body text-mid-gray text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\\\"\\u003eWho has access to AI tools, and how? Key questions:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"font-body text-mid-gray text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\\\"\\u003e\\u003cul class=\\\"list-disc space-y-1 my-3 pl-2\\\"\\u003e\\u003cli class=\\\"ml-4 text-mid-gray\\\"\\u003eAre AI tools accessed via individual accounts or shared credentials?\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli class=\\\"ml-4 text-mid-gray\\\"\\u003eIs SSO enforced where available?\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli class=\\\"ml-4 text-mid-gray\\\"\\u003eAre departing employees' AI accounts deprovisioned?\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli class=\\\"ml-4 text-mid-gray\\\"\\u003eWhat permissions does each AI tool request?\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3 class=\\\"font-display text-navy text-lg font-bold mt-8 mb-3\\\"\\u003eDomain 4: Vendor \\u0026 Third-Party Risk\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"font-body text-mid-gray text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\\\"\\u003eThe AI vendor is a third-party processor of your data. You should review:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"font-body text-mid-gray text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\\\"\\u003e\\u003cul class=\\\"list-disc space-y-1 my-3 pl-2\\\"\\u003e\\u003cli class=\\\"ml-4 text-mid-gray\\\"\\u003eData Processing Agreement (DPA) availability and terms\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli class=\\\"ml-4 text-mid-gray\\\"\\u003eSub-processor list\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli class=\\\"ml-4 text-mid-gray\\\"\\u003eIncident response SLA\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli class=\\\"ml-4 text-mid-gray\\\"\\u003eSOC 2 Type II certification status\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli class=\\\"ml-4 text-mid-gray\\\"\\u003eData residency and retention policies\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\nMost SMBs have signed zero DPAs with their AI vendors. That's an immediate compliance gap under GDPR and a liability risk under HIPAA.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"font-body text-mid-gray text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\\\"\\u003e\\u003ch3 class=\\\"font-display text-navy text-lg font-bold mt-8 mb-3\\\"\\u003eDomain 5: Policy \\u0026 Governance\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"font-body text-mid-gray text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\\\"\\u003eDoes the organization have written policies covering AI use? Specifically:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"font-body text-mid-gray text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\\\"\\u003e\\u003cul class=\\\"list-disc space-y-1 my-3 pl-2\\\"\\u003e\\u003cli class=\\\"ml-4 text-mid-gray\\\"\\u003eAI Acceptable Use Policy (AUP)\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli class=\\\"ml-4 text-mid-gray\\\"\\u003eAI tool approval process\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli class=\\\"ml-4 text-mid-gray\\\"\\u003eIncident response procedures that cover AI-related breaches\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli class=\\\"ml-4 text-mid-gray\\\"\\u003eTraining records for AI risk awareness\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n73% of SMBs have no AI AUP. This is both the easiest problem to fix and the one with the most immediate legal exposure.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"font-body text-mid-gray text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\\\"\\u003e\\u003ch3 class=\\\"font-display text-navy text-lg font-bold mt-8 mb-3\\\"\\u003eDomain 6: Compliance Alignment\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"font-body text-mid-gray text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\\\"\\u003eThe final domain maps findings against applicable regulatory frameworks:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"font-body text-mid-gray text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\\\"\\u003e\\u003cul class=\\\"list-disc space-y-1 my-3 pl-2\\\"\\u003e\\u003cli class=\\\"ml-4 text-mid-gray\\\"\\u003e\\u003cstrong class=\\\"text-navy font-semibold\\\"\\u003eHIPAA\\u003c/strong\\u003e: Does PHI flow through AI tools? Is there a BAA in place?\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli class=\\\"ml-4 text-mid-gray\\\"\\u003e\\u003cstrong class=\\\"text-navy font-semibold\\\"\\u003eGDPR\\u003c/strong\\u003e: Is there a lawful basis for AI data processing? Is there a DPA?\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli class=\\\"ml-4 text-mid-gray\\\"\\u003e\\u003cstrong class=\\\"text-navy font-semibold\\\"\\u003eSOC 2\\u003c/strong\\u003e: Do AI tools fall within the audit scope? Are relevant controls documented?\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\\"font-display text-navy text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4\\\"\\u003eWhat Goes Into the Audit Report\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"font-body text-mid-gray text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\\\"\\u003eA professional AI security audit report includes:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"font-body text-mid-gray text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\\\"\\u003e1. \\u003cstrong class=\\\"text-navy font-semibold\\\"\\u003eExecutive Summary\\u003c/strong\\u003e — Overall risk score (1–10), top 3 critical findings, one-page summary\\n2. \\u003cstrong class=\\\"text-navy font-semibold\\\"\\u003eAI Tool Inventory\\u003c/strong\\u003e — Full list with risk classification for each tool\\n3. \\u003cstrong class=\\\"text-navy font-semibold\\\"\\u003eFindings \\u0026 Risk Matrix\\u003c/strong\\u003e — All findings rated Critical/High/Medium/Low\\n4. \\u003cstrong class=\\\"text-navy font-semibold\\\"\\u003eCompliance Gap Analysis\\u003c/strong\\u003e — Specific gaps against applicable frameworks\\n5. \\u003cstrong class=\\\"text-navy font-semibold\\\"\\u003ePrioritized Recommendations\\u003c/strong\\u003e — Specific, actionable fixes for every finding\\n6. \\u003cstrong class=\\\"text-navy font-semibold\\\"\\u003e30/60/90-Day Roadmap\\u003c/strong\\u003e — (Enterprise tier) Sequenced implementation plan\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"font-body text-mid-gray text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\\\"\\u003e\\u003ch2 class=\\\"font-display text-navy text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4\\\"\\u003eHow Long Does an AI Security Audit Take?\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"font-body text-mid-gray text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\\\"\\u003eFor a Basic tier engagement (up to 3 tools), the timeline is typically:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"font-body text-mid-gray text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\\\"\\u003e\\u003cul class=\\\"list-disc space-y-1 my-3 pl-2\\\"\\u003e\\u003cli class=\\\"ml-4 text-mid-gray\\\"\\u003eDay 1: Intake questionnaire sent, client completes within 24 hours\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli class=\\\"ml-4 text-mid-gray\\\"\\u003eDays 2–3: Analysis, framework mapping, findings documentation\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli class=\\\"ml-4 text-mid-gray\\\"\\u003eDays 4–5: Report writing, quality review\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli class=\\\"ml-4 text-mid-gray\\\"\\u003eDay 5: Report delivered\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\nStandard and Enterprise engagements add time for additional interviews, deeper data flow analysis, and roadmap development.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"font-body text-mid-gray text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\\\"\\u003e\\u003ch2 class=\\\"font-display text-navy text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4\\\"\\u003eGetting Started\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"font-body text-mid-gray text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\\\"\\u003eThe fastest way to understand your AI risk posture is to download the \\u003ca href=\\\"/free-risk-overview\\\" class=\\\"text-teal hover:text-teal-lt underline underline-offset-2 transition-colors\\\"\\u003efree AI Security Risk Overview\\u003c/a\\u003e — it covers the five risks this guide addresses in a format you can use to brief your leadership team.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"font-body text-mid-gray text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\\\"\\u003eIf you're ready to get a professional assessment, \\u003ca href=\\\"/audit\\\" class=\\\"text-teal hover:text-teal-lt underline underline-offset-2 transition-colors\\\"\\u003ebook a free discovery call\\u003c/a\\u003e and we'll scope the engagement together.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"6:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",null,{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"@context\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://schema.org\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Article\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"headline\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"The Complete AI Security Audit Guide for 2026\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"description\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"A practitioner's walkthrough of everything you need to conduct a comprehensive AI security audit — from scoping the engagement to delivering the report. Covers NIST AI RMF, OWASP LLM Top 10, and the 6-Domain methodology.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"author\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Person\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Jamel Rainey\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://www.aitrustaudit.com/about\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"publisher\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Organization\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"AITrustAudit.com\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://www.aitrustaudit.com\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"datePublished\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-05-04T11:42:16.973Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"mainEntityOfPage\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://www.aitrustaudit.com/blog/complete-ai-security-audit-guide-2026\\\\\\\"}\\\"}}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-navy pt-16 pb-12 px-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"max-w-3xl mx-auto\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L11\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/blog\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-gray-500 hover:text-teal-lt text-sm transition-colors\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"← Blog\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-600\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"/\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-display text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full\\\",\\\"style\\\":{\\\"backgroundColor\\\":\\\"rgba(0,172,193,0.15)\\\",\\\"color\\\":\\\"#00ACC1\\\"},\\\"children\\\":\\\"Practitioner How-Tos\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h1\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-display text-white text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black leading-tight mb-4 text-glow\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"The Complete AI Security Audit Guide for 2026\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-sm font-body text-gray-500\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"By Jamel Rainey\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"·\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"May 2026\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"·\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"14 min read\\\"}],[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"·\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-teal-lt font-semibold\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"+ Free Template\\\"}]]]}]]}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-white py-12 px-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"max-w-3xl mx-auto\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-navy text-xl leading-relaxed mb-8 font-medium border-l-4 border-teal pl-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"A practitioner's walkthrough of everything you need to conduct a comprehensive AI security audit — from scoping the engagement to delivering the report. Covers NIST AI RMF, OWASP LLM Top 10, and the 6-Domain methodology.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mb-8 bg-teal-bg rounded-xl p-5 border border-teal/20 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center gap-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-3xl\\\",\\\"aria-hidden\\\":\\\"true\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"📄\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex-1\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-display text-navy text-sm font-bold mb-0.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Free Template Available\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-mid-gray text-sm\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Download the free template mentioned in this article — no account required.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L11\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/free-risk-overview\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"shrink-0 bg-teal hover:bg-teal-lt text-white font-display font-bold text-xs px-4 py-2 rounded-lg tracking-wide transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Get Free Template →\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"article\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"prose-article max-w-none\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$12\\\"}}],\\\"$L13\\\"]}]}],\\\"$L14\\\",\\\"$L15\\\",\\\"$L16\\\"]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"17:I[3243,[\\\"619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/619-ba102abea3e3d0e4.js\\\",\\\"953\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/blog/%5Bslug%5D/page-ed7100482b98e3a0.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"13:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-12 border-t border-divider pt-8 flex items-start gap-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"w-14 h-14 bg-navy rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-display text-teal-lt text-sm font-black\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"JR\\\"}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-display text-navy text-sm font-bold\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Jamel Rainey\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-teal text-xs font-semibold mb-2\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"AI Security Leader · AITrustAudit.com\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-mid-gray text-sm\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Building the practitioner’s resource for AI security auditing. If you have to actually do the work — not just read about it — this is your home base.\\\"}]]}]]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"14:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-light-bg py-12 px-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"max-w-3xl mx-auto bg-navy rounded-2xl p-8 text-center\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"section-label mb-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"// FREE RESOURCE\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-display text-white text-2xl font-bold mb-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Get the Free AI Security Risk Overview\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-gray-400 mb-6\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Used by 500+ security professionals. The 5 risks your leadership team needs to understand right now.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L11\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/free-risk-overview\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"inline-block bg-teal hover:bg-teal-lt text-white font-display font-bold text-sm px-7 py-3 rounded-lg tracking-wide transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-lt\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Download Free Risk Overview →\\\"}]]}]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"15:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-white py-16 px-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-display text-navy text-2xl font-bold mb-8\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"More from the Blog\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L11\\\",\\\"nist-ai-rmf-explained\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/blog/nist-ai-rmf-explained\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"group block bg-light-bg rounded-xl border border-divider p-5 hover:border-teal transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-display text-xs font-bold text-teal-lt uppercase tracking-wide block mb-2\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Framework Guides\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h3\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-display text-navy text-sm font-bold mb-2 group-hover:text-teal transition-colors leading-snug\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"NIST AI RMF 1.0 Explained in Plain English\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-mid-gray text-xs\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"9 min read\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L11\\\",\\\"how-to-write-ai-acceptable-use-policy\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/blog/how-to-write-ai-acceptable-use-policy\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"group block bg-light-bg rounded-xl border border-divider p-5 hover:border-teal transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-display text-xs font-bold text-teal-lt uppercase tracking-wide block mb-2\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Practitioner How-Tos\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h3\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-display text-navy text-sm font-bold mb-2 group-hover:text-teal transition-colors leading-snug\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"How to Write an AI Acceptable Use Policy (Free Template)\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-mid-gray text-xs\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"8 min read\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L11\\\",\\\"shadow-ai-what-it-is-why-dangerous-how-to-find-it\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/blog/shadow-ai-what-it-is-why-dangerous-how-to-find-it\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"group block bg-light-bg rounded-xl border border-divider p-5 hover:border-teal transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-display text-xs font-bold text-teal-lt uppercase tracking-wide block mb-2\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"AI Risk Education\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h3\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-display text-navy text-sm font-bold mb-2 group-hover:text-teal transition-colors leading-snug\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Shadow AI: What It Is, Why It's Dangerous, and How to Find It\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-mid-gray text-xs\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"7 min read\\\"}]]}]]}]]}]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"16:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L17\\\",null,{\\\"headline\\\":\\\"Ready to Audit Your AI Stack?\\\",\\\"subhead\\\":\\\"Professional AI security audit reports starting at $499. Delivered in 5 business days.\\\",\\\"primaryCTA\\\":{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Book a Free Discovery Call\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://calendly.com\\\"},\\\"secondaryCTA\\\":{\\\"label\\\":\\\"See Audit Service\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/audit\\\"}}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"c:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"charSet\\\":\\\"utf-8\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"viewport\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\"}]]\\n8:null\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"18:I[622,[],\\\"IconMark\\\"]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"a:{\\\"metadata\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"title\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"The Complete AI Security Audit Guide for 2026 | AITrustAudit.com\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"description\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"A practitioner's walkthrough of everything you need to conduct a comprehensive AI security audit — from scoping the engagement to delivering the report. Covers NIST AI RMF, OWASP LLM Top 10, and the 6-Domain methodology.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"author\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://www.aitrustaudit.com/about\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"3\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"author\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Jamel Rainey\