-acceptable-use-policy\",{\"href\":\"/blog/how-to-write-ai-acceptable-use-policy\",\"className\":\"group block bg-light-bg rounded-xl border border-divider p-5 hover:border-teal transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-xs font-bold text-teal-lt uppercase tracking-wide block mb-2\",\"children\":\"Practitioner How-Tos\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-navy text-sm font-bold mb-2 group-hover:text-teal transition-colors leading-snug\",\"children\":\"How to Write an AI Acceptable Use Policy (Free Template)\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-mid-gray text-xs\",\"children\":\"8 min read\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L11\",\"shadow-ai-what-it-is-why-dangerous-how-to-find-it\",{\"href\":\"/blog/shadow-ai-what-it-is-why-dangerous-how-to-find-it\",\"className\":\"group block bg-light-bg rounded-xl border border-divider p-5 hover:border-teal transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-xs font-bold text-teal-lt uppercase tracking-wide block mb-2\",\"children\":\"AI Risk Education\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-navy text-sm font-bold mb-2 group-hover:text-teal transition-colors leading-snug\",\"children\":\"Shadow AI: What It Is, Why It's Dangerous, and How to Find It\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-mid-gray text-xs\",\"children\":\"7 min read\"}]]}]]}]]}]}]\n16:[\"$\",\"$L17\",null,{\"headline\":\"Ready to Audit Your AI Stack?\",\"subhead\":\"Professional AI security audit reports starting at $499. Delivered in 5 business days.\",\"primaryCTA\":{\"label\":\"Book a Free Discovery Call\",\"href\":\"https://calendly.com\"},\"secondaryCTA\":{\"label\":\"See Audit Service\",\"href\":\"/audit\"}}]\nc:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\